8. Welcomes the continued engagement and mediation efforts of the Intergovernmental Authority on Development (IGAD), the African Union, and other regional initiatives, including the high-level peace talks in Nairobi (Tumaini Initiative), and urges all South Sudanese stakeholders to actively and constructively engage in these complementary processes to consolidate sustainable peace;

